	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist determines that a client requires specialized cultural and clinical knowledge that the therapist does not possess. Appropriate consultation is unavailable, the limitation is already affecting assessment, and continuing treatment may place the client at risk. A qualified provider is available.What is the most appropriate response?',
